{
  "info": {
    "name": "StudioFlow Admin API",
    "_postman_id": "b1e9f0a2-0000-4000-8000-studioflow001",
    "description": "Admin API for StudioFlow (apps/admin/app/api).\n\n## Authentication\nTwo tokens are involved:\n\n- **Access token (JWT)** — returned in the JSON body of `POST /auth/login` and `POST /auth/refresh`. Send it on every protected request as `Authorization: Bearer <accessToken>`. This collection captures it automatically into the `{{accessToken}}` variable (see the *Tests* tab of Login / Refresh) and uses it via collection-level Bearer auth, so protected requests just work after you log in.\n- **Refresh token** — set automatically as an HttpOnly cookie (`refresh_token`, `Path=/api/auth`, 7 days). You never handle it manually; Postman's cookie jar sends it back to `POST /auth/refresh`.\n\n### Permissions catalog\nRoles hold a subset of:\n```\nprojects:create  projects:edit  projects:publish  projects:delete\nmedia:upload     media:delete   clients:manage    services:manage\nhomepage:manage  users:manage   roles:manage      settings:manage\n```\n- User routes require `users:manage`.\n- Role & permission routes require `roles:manage`.\n\n### Getting started\n1. Set the `baseUrl` variable (default `http://localhost:3000`).\n2. Run **Auth → Login** with valid credentials — `{{accessToken}}` is captured automatically.\n3. Call any protected request. To rotate, run **Auth → Refresh**.\n\n## Error codes\n`400` validation / malformed body · `401` missing or invalid token · `403` missing permission · `404` not found · `409` conflict (duplicate or version mismatch) · `429` too many login attempts.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:3000", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "accessToken", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "userId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "roleId", "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "description": "Login, token refresh, and logout. Login and Refresh auto-capture the access token.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "login"] },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"owner@studio.test\",\n  \"password\": \"correcthorse\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "### What it does\n**Public.** Authenticates a user by email + password. On success it signs a short-lived **access token (JWT)**, creates a rotating **refresh token** stored as an HttpOnly cookie, and returns the user with their role and permissions.\n\nRate-limited to **5 attempts / 60s per IP** (429 when exceeded). The *Tests* script saves `accessToken`, `userId`, and `roleId` into collection variables automatically.\n\n### Request body\n```json\n{ \"email\": \"owner@studio.test\", \"password\": \"correcthorse\" }\n```\n\n### Returns\n**200 OK** — `{ accessToken, user: { id, name, email, role: { id, name, permissions[] } } }` and a `Set-Cookie: refresh_token=...` header.\n\n### Errors\n- `400` malformed body (invalid email / missing password)\n- `401` invalid credentials **or** deactivated account\n- `429` too many attempts"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (json.accessToken) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', json.accessToken);",
                  "    console.log('accessToken captured');",
                  "  }",
                  "  if (json.user && json.user.id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', json.user.id);",
                  "  }",
                  "  if (json.user && json.user.role && json.user.role.id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('roleId', json.user.role.id);",
                  "  }",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('login succeeded', function () { pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.eql(200); });"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "login"] },
                "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"owner@studio.test\",\n  \"password\": \"correcthorse\"\n}" }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
                { "key": "Set-Cookie", "value": "refresh_token=<opaque>; HttpOnly; Secure; SameSite=Lax; Path=/api/auth; Max-Age=604800" }
              ],
              "cookie": [],
              "body": "{\n  \"accessToken\": \"eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VySWQiOiIzZi4uLiIsInJvbGVJZCI6IjFhLi4uIn0.sig\",\n  \"user\": {\n    \"id\": \"3f8b1c2d-0000-4000-8000-000000000001\",\n    \"name\": \"Studio Owner\",\n    \"email\": \"owner@studio.test\",\n    \"role\": {\n      \"id\": \"1a2b3c4d-0000-4000-8000-000000000000\",\n      \"name\": \"Owner\",\n      \"permissions\": [\"projects:create\", \"users:manage\", \"roles:manage\", \"settings:manage\"]\n    }\n  }\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "401 Invalid credentials",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "login"] },
                "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"owner@studio.test\",\n  \"password\": \"wrong\"\n}" }
              },
              "status": "Unauthorized",
              "code": 401,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "cookie": [],
              "body": "{\n  \"error\": \"Invalid credentials\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "429 Too many attempts",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "login"] },
                "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"owner@studio.test\",\n  \"password\": \"correcthorse\"\n}" }
              },
              "status": "Too Many Requests",
              "code": 429,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "cookie": [],
              "body": "{\n  \"error\": \"Too many attempts\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "refresh"] },
            "description": "### What it does\n**Cookie-based.** Reads the `refresh_token` cookie (set by Login), revokes it, verifies the user is still active, then issues a **new access token** and a **new rotated refresh token**. No body and no Authorization header required. The *Tests* script updates `{{accessToken}}`.\n\n### Request body\n_None._ Postman's cookie jar sends `refresh_token` automatically.\n\n### Returns\n**200 OK** — `{ accessToken }` plus a fresh `Set-Cookie: refresh_token=...`.\n\n### Errors\n- `401` no refresh token, invalid/expired/revoked token, or the user is no longer active"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (json.accessToken) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', json.accessToken);",
                  "    console.log('accessToken refreshed');",
                  "  }",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [],
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "refresh"] }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
                { "key": "Set-Cookie", "value": "refresh_token=<new-opaque>; HttpOnly; Secure; SameSite=Lax; Path=/api/auth; Max-Age=604800" }
              ],
              "cookie": [],
              "body": "{\n  \"accessToken\": \"eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.newtoken.sig\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "401 No refresh token",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [],
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "refresh"] }
              },
              "status": "Unauthorized",
              "code": 401,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "cookie": [],
              "body": "{\n  \"error\": \"No refresh token\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "logout"] },
            "description": "### What it does\n🔒 **Requires access token** (any authenticated user). Revokes **all** refresh tokens for the current user (logs them out everywhere) and clears the `refresh_token` cookie. Uses collection Bearer auth (`{{accessToken}}`).\n\n### Request body\n_None._\n\n### Returns\n**200 OK** — `{ ok: true }` plus a `Set-Cookie` that expires the refresh cookie.\n\n### Errors\n- `401` missing / invalid access token"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [],
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "logout"] }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
                { "key": "Set-Cookie", "value": "refresh_token=; HttpOnly; Secure; SameSite=Lax; Path=/api/auth; Max-Age=0" }
              ],
              "cookie": [],
              "body": "{\n  \"ok\": true\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "401 Unauthorized",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [],
                "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "auth", "logout"] }
              },
              "status": "Unauthorized",
              "code": 401,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "cookie": [],
              "body": "{\n  \"error\": \"Unauthorized\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
