            "description": "### What it does\n🔒 `users:manage`. Creates a new user, hashes the password, and assigns the given role.\n\nRules: `name` 1–200 chars, valid `email`, `password` ≥ 8 chars, `roleId` a UUID that exists.\n\n### Request body\n```json\n{ \"name\": \"Jane Editor\", \"email\": \"jane@studio.test\", \"password\": \"atleast8chars\", \"roleId\": \"<uuid>\" }\n```\n\n### Returns\n**201 Created** — the new user object (no password hash), starting at `version: 1`.\n\n### Errors\n- `400` validation failure\n- `401` · `403`\n- `409` email already in use"
